865	     * The number of owners a city must already hold before a create in it is flagged with a
866	     * capacity warning. Once a city holds at least this many owners - but is still below the
867	     * {@value #CITY_CAPACITY} hard limit - it is approaching capacity and the new owner's
868	     * {@code capacityWarning} is true.
